{
  "name": "Back-dated MTM valuations for counterparty audit requests",
  "today": "Counterparties' auditors need third-party valuations of their derivatives, and the Confirmations group (Larry Joe Hunter, Ellen Wallumrod) must supply them. Confirmations has no system that values deals, so each request is emailed to every Risk desk head (5 or 6 of them). Each desk head forwards it to an analyst, who pulls a mini-book for that counterparty as of a past date, exports it to Excel, blacks out sensitive columns (Delta/Vol) and replies. Confirmations then combines the desk replies. Hunter says requests come several times a week.",
  "change": "Give Confirmations a read-only report that values a counterparty's deals across all desks as of a past date, so Risk analysts no longer do it by hand.",
  "explanation": "Finish the tool Hunter describes: a read-only valuation report (the planned on-line EnTelligence, or a standard report from the risk system) that keeps back-dated curves and returns MTM value and open position by counterparty short name across all desks, with Delta/Vol left out. Confirmations enters the short name and as-of date, runs the report and sends it to the auditor. Desk heads and risk analysts are no longer involved.",
  "occurrences": [
    {
      "file": "corpus/giron-d/sent/240.eml",
      "quote": "Please forward to Ellen Wallumrod the MTM valuation(mini-book) for all \nCoEnergy Trading Company deals as of Dec 31, 2000.  If you can export into \nexcel and forward by e-mail, that would be appreciated."
    },
    {
      "file": "corpus/giron-d/sent/214.eml",
      "quote": "Can you provide MTM values as of Dec 29, 2000, for the short name of CROSS \nTIMBERS."
    },
    {
      "file": "corpus/giron-d/sent/137.eml",
      "quote": "Two more counterparties need MTM values for Dec. 29, 2000."
    },
    {
      "file": "corpus/giron-d/sent/136.eml",
      "quote": "The total MTM value \nfor the West Desk are as follows.  Detail can be found in the attachment."
    }
  ],
  "evidence": [
    {
      "file": "corpus/giron-d/sent/241.eml",
      "quote": "We do not have access to \nany system that values these deals, but are looking to get the on-line \n\"EnTelligence\" built so that it carries back-dated curves that will allow us \nto complete these requests without taking up a Risk person's time and without \nhaving to black out information (Delta/Vol) that is included in a mini-book.",
      "note": "Confirmations itself says the work takes Risk staff time, includes blacking out Delta/Vol, and would go away with a back-dated valuation tool."
    },
    {
      "file": "corpus/giron-d/sent/241.eml",
      "quote": "Until we can get EnTelligence built to our specifications, \nwe'll need to continue to go to the different desks to provide Mark-to-Market \nvaluations for a Counterparty's portfolio.",
      "note": "Every request goes to all desks; the request in 214.eml went to 6 desk heads, those in 240.eml and 137.eml to 5."
    },
    {
      "file": "corpus/giron-d/sent/137.eml",
      "quote": "Please provide the total MTM value for that date within your region.",
      "note": "Each desk produces its own regional figure, so the work is repeated once per desk for each request."
    }
  ],
  "stalls": [],
  "ongoing": true,
  "stated_rate": {
    "count": 3,
    "per": "week",
    "file": "corpus/giron-d/sent/241.eml",
    "quote": "we recieve several \nper week"
  },
  "minutes": 92
}

